/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Tauri-generated capability schemas — regenerated on every build.
**/gen/schemas

# Tauri updater SIGNING KEYS — private key material, never committed.
#
# `docs/HUD-RELEASE.md` (starplatform) has the operator run
#   cargo tauri signer generate -w org-hud.key
# which writes the PRIVATE key as an untracked file. In a PUBLIC repo a committed signing key is
# not merely leaked, it is world-readable the moment it is pushed — and key material cannot be
# removed from history by a later commit, only rotated.
#
# The PUBLIC key is not secret: it is committed deliberately, in hud/tauri.conf.json.
org-hud.key
*.key
